<title>USA: PPG says LeBoeuf named CEO.</title>
<headline>PPG says LeBoeuf named CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPG Industries said Thursday president Raymond LeBoeuf will add the chief executive title to his duties on July 1.</p>
<p>Jerry Dempsey, board chairman and CEO, will remain chairman until his November 1 retirement, the company said.</p>
<p>PPG said Frank Archinaco, 53, senior vice president, glass, and E. Kears Pollock, 56, senior vice president, coatings and resins, were named executive vice presidents and assigned broader responsibilities.</p>
</text>
